From 9c80bb245df4c75697af70938d0d583fe391793e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack <jack@saltern.studio>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 09:58:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add referral-code pricing, commission ledger, and partner
 dashboard
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- referral_codes + commission_ledger tables, partners.commission_rate
  (supabase/migrations/0012_referral_pricing_and_commission_ledger.sql)
- services/referral.service.js: single source of truth for referral
  pricing, used by both the /api/pricing quote and the /api/payments/
  initialize charge, so a shown price and a charged price can never
  drift — 8 passing unit tests covering invalid/expired/exhausted/
  wrong-tier codes all falling through safely
- payments.controller.js + webhooks.controller.js: record a commission-
  ledger entry exactly once, gated by the existing atomic idempotency
  check that already guards fulfillment
- partners.controller.js: referral-code create/deactivate, partner
  dashboard endpoint (clicks/conversions/pending/paid), click tracking,
  and payout recording that now auto-settles the commission ledger
- fixed a bug from the previous commit: sendPartnerPayoutDetailsRequest
  and sendPayoutSent were defined but never exported from
  email.service.js — would have thrown at runtime on first use
- frontend: referral-code capture (?ref=CODE) persisted and applied
  through checkout (FixBanner/ScanResult/usePricing), a partner-facing
  /partner/dashboard stats page, and admin UI for creating referral
  codes and recording payouts prefilled from the pending ledger balance
